      "value": "@MehStrongBadMeh I like your request, but  I don't agree on the finger gesture animations, I think that, with the control of all your hand, that means that we can assign a gesture with an animation for a single finger, up to 32 animations that we can have. For example, I make the rock and roll gesture with my hand, and with that gesture I assign a facial gesture, that way we can make the gesture in a very very natural way, not like the that way with the touchstrip, because it wouldn't be natural, and with the Knuckles we want it to be very natural, like in the real life.",
